+# Force the runfiles layout without the legacy `external/<repo>/...` mirror,
+# so File.short_path form (`../<repo>/...`) is the ONLY runfiles-visible
+# path. Backport of upstream PR 204489: all lit_expand_template callers use
+# short_path, and older Bazel versions' File.short_path on external files
+# returns `external/<repo>/...` when legacy is on, which lit can't resolve
+# from the test's runfiles CWD.
+common --nolegacy_external_runfiles
+
